000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TSUMCHGS.
000400 AUTHOR.               MK MADDEN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         JULY 1, 1985.
000600*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700
000800*REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THROUGH THE
000900*                      DETAIL TRANSACTION DATA SET
001000*                      AND FIND ALL ISS, ADJ, RET, AND
001100*                      DCHG TRANSACTIONS AND SORT AND PRINT TOTALS
001200*                      BY REPORT CODE, DIVISION CODE, LEDGER CODE
001300*                      CLASS AND DEPT/ACCOUNT ORDER.
      *C
      *C  04DEC1992       DAVE PLUM       REQUEST #6325
      *C  REVISED PARAGRAPH 500-GET-MMATL-ACCUM TO INCLUDE THE
      *C  IF STATEMENT 'IF TRANS-CODE = "INV" OR "FRT"', INSTEAD OF
      *C  'IF TRANS-CODE = "INV"'.  FRT CHARGES FOR CODED ITEMS HAVING
      *C  NEW-WORK NUMBERS WERE NOT BEING TREATED THE SAME AS INVOICE
      *C  CHARGES.
      *C
      *C  07MAR1994       DAVE PLUM
      *C  ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  07JUL1994       CR KALMAN       REQUEST #6232
      *C  REVISED THIS PROGRAM TO MAKE USE OF THE STANDARDIZED
      *C  BLOWUP ROUTINE, TBLOWUP.
      *C
      *C  08JUL1994       CR KALMAN       REQUEST #6090
      *C  REVISED SUMMARY OF CHARGES REPORT TO HANDLE INVALID DEPTS.
      *C  IT NO LONGER BLOWS UP WHEN AN INVALID DEPT IS FOUND.  IT
      *C  NOW PRINTS AN "INVALID DEPT" MESSAGE NEAR THE INVALID DEPT
      *C  AND AN ERROR MESSAGE IS PRINTED CONSPICUOUSLY AT THE END
      *C  OF THE REPORT.  ALSO AT THE END OF THE PROGRAM, THE FILE
      *C  VOCHRFLE IS DELETED.
      *C
      *C  03SEP1996       CA YODER
      *C  MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  06AUG1997       JE COFFMAN
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO WRITE A SECOND FILE (VOCHRFL2) THAT REFLECTS
      *C  A SEPARATION OF TOTALS FOR "WITHDRAWAL" TRANSACTIONS (ISS,
      *C  RET, RETV,SADJ, AND AADJ). THIS FILE WILL THEN BE USED BY
      *C  THE UNION-CITY WRITTEN CHECKBOOK PROGRAM TO PRODUCE THE
      *C  DANVILLE REQUESTED TOTAL BREAKDOWNS.
      *C
DP9802*C  05FEB1998      DAVE PLUM
DP9802*C  ADDED LOGIC TO HANDLE Y2K FOR THE YEAR-H3A FIELD.
      *C
