           ADD DEPT-ACCT-STANDARD TO DIV-STANDARD.
           ADD DEPT-ACCT-VARIANCE TO DIV-VARIANCE.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM DETAIL-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 2.
           ADD 2 TO LINE-CNT.
           IF LINE-CNT > 55
               PERFORM 750-PRINT-HEADINGS.
           IF SORT-SEQ = 1
               PERFORM 800-VOUCHER
           ELSE
               NEXT SENTENCE.

