9407CK 990-BLOWUP.
  .        MOVE "  CSACCT;" TO BASE.
  .        MOVE "TSUMCHGS" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
  .        CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
  .           DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
  .           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
  .
  .   * * * * * * * * * * * OLD BLOWUP ROUTINE  * * * * * * * *
  .   *990-BLOWUP.                                            *
  .   *                                                       *
  .   *    DISPLAY "**********************************".      *
  .   *    DISPLAY "**          TSUMCHGS            **".      *
  .   *    DISPLAY "** WRITE DOWN THE FOLLOWING AND **".      *
  .   *    DISPLAY "**   CONTACT PROGRAMMING STAFF  **".      *
  .   *    DISPLAY "**********************************".      *
  .   *    DISPLAY BU-DISPLAY-AREA.                           *
  .   *    DISPLAY "FILE-STATUS = " FILE-STATUS.              *
  .   *                                                       *
  .   *    PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF.                          *
  .   *    GOBACK.                                            *
9407CK* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *

       1000-CLOSE-FILES.
